# Josh OS reads no environment variables at the moment.
# No API keys, tokens or passwords are written in the code.
#
# Where the keys live instead:
#   Stripe and Calendly   entered on the Admin page, saved to Data/admin.json
#   Kit                   entered on the Email page, saved to Data/kit.json
#   OBS websocket         read from %APPDATA%/obs-studio/plugin_config/obs-websocket/config.json
#
# Data/ is in .gitignore, so these never reach git.
# If a key is ever moved into an environment variable, list its name here with no value.
